    "detailed_description": "In the jelly world\u2026. you get a jelly pet! A pet that needs to be fed, cleaned and taken care of.<br>Luckily, there's something it can do for you, too!<br><br>Battle and earn cool stuff that you can use with your pet, and be careful - those battles get more difficult as you go! <br>Jellies are pretty smart beings, so prepare to play smart to win in the puzzles! Make your enemies gel-ous of your smarts.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The jelly caretaker's duties:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Feed the jelly<br></li><li>Pet the jelly<br></li><li>Play with the jelly<br></li><li>Clean the jelly<br></li><li>Love the jelly<br></li><li>Seek and destroy everything that stands in your jelly's way to victory and delicious fruit!</li></ul>",
